 ==========================
 Support and Valued Service
 ==========================

 At some point in the use of a product, almost every programmer will need
 technical support.  This is an item that is often overlooked when purchasing
 a software library.  Many companies make claims but fall short when it comes 
 to crunch time.  

 Call South Mountain Software and you will find experienced programmers on the 
 other end of the line.  They are the same people who write our code.  They know
 that our products are judged not only by the quality of our work, but by the 
 quality of the programs that you create.  After all, your reputation and ours
 is riding on the final result.

 Our technical support lines are open Monday through Friday, 9:00 A.M. to 
 5:00 P.M. E.S.T.  Besides phone support, our BBS and FAX lines are available 
 24 hours a day for you to use.
